{#-
  cycle.done SSE fragment — replaces the static "Идёт проверка" spinner
  injected by POST /cycle/run into #cycle-result.

  Producer: src/fis_monitor/web/sse_encoder.py renders this partial when an
  SseCycleDone event arrives on the bus. The fragment is consumed by the
  hidden listener span #cycle-done-listener in base.html.jinja which targets
  #cycle-result with hx-swap="innerHTML".

  Context: ``event`` is the SseCycleDone instance (NOT a Lot — no PII).
  Available fields: ``status``, ``lots_fetched``, ``new_lots``,
  ``duration_ms`` (StrictInt non-negative), ``cycle_id``.
-#}
{%- if event.status == "ok" -%}
<span class="cycle-result cycle-result--ok">Проверка завершена: {{ event.lots_fetched }} лотов, {{ event.new_lots }} новых ({{ (event.duration_ms / 1000) | round(1) }} с)</span>
{%- else -%}
<span class="cycle-result cycle-result--err">Проверка завершена с ошибкой</span>
{%- endif -%}
